id: ops-3xyb
title: ops verify-release times out on real full package gate after five minutes
description: "A real opted-in fleet acceptance run on pm-ops and pm-graph passed ops scan but ops verify-release terminated pm-graph npm run release:check at 300110 ms with spawnSync npm ETIMEDOUT. The direct pm-graph release gate passed on the same pushed head. The fixed per-step five-minute limit is too short for this legitimate package gate and makes the fleet verifier report a false release failure."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:release","type:defect"
created_at: "2026-09-27T08:00:08.494Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T12:23:09.757Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T18:44:37.608Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T18:44:37.608Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "The real opted-in fleet test passes against two canonical packages, including pm-graph release:check; the timeout remains bounded and actionable; the complete pm-ops release gate, strict PM health, and exact-head CI/review pass."
repro_steps: "Set PM_OPS_TEST_REPOS to the canonical pm-ops and pm-graph paths, then run node --test --test-name-pattern=real-data: test/ops.test.ts. The scan passes 2/2; the second real-data test fails after 300110 ms with ETIMEDOUT."
resolution: "Reverified main 5804578: PR #124 (450e2bec) raises verify-release per-step execution to a bounded 20 minutes. The retained delivery receipt reports opted-in real pm-ops/pm-graph checks passing 2/2, with pm-graph release:check finishing in 432431 ms and verify-release reporting 1/1 repositories passed. Evidence: index.ts bounded timeout, test/ops.test.ts and dated item comments. No new live fleet run is asserted."
expected_result: The verifier allows a bounded full package gate to finish and reports its real result; an actual stalled gate still ends with a clear timeout.
actual_result: "Retained delivery evidence records corrected opted-in real-data checks passing 2/2, pm-graph release:check completing in 432431 ms and verify-release reporting 1/1 repositories passed. Main 5804578 implements the bounded 20-minute step timeout. This tracker-only review did not rerun external fleet checks."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T12:23:09.752Z",codex-agent,"Same-class self-review found actual_result still described the pre-fix 300110 ms failure despite dated comments recording the corrected 432431 ms success. Updated that field and both closeout fields to distinguish historical failure, retained delivery evidence and current source inspection. PR #124 is merged and 450e2bec is an ancestor of main 5804578. No runtime or timeout changes."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-27T08:08:24.810Z","harness:codex","2026-09-27: TDD real fleet evidence: before the source change, PM_OPS_TEST_REPOS=pm-ops,pm-graph node --test --test-name-pattern=real-data: test/ops.test.ts passed scan 2/2 but failed verify-release at 300110 ms with spawnSync npm ETIMEDOUT. After raising the bounded per-step timeout from 5 to 20 minutes, the exact same two real-data tests passed 2/2 with zero skips; pm-graph release:check finished in 432431 ms and verify-release reported 1/1 repos passed. The full pm-ops release gate and strict health remain to be rerun on this source head."
  "2026-09-27T08:12:09.015Z","harness:codex","2026-09-27 08:12 UTC: The corrected source passed the complete npm run release:check gate: 444 passed tests, two pre-existing real-data skips in the default environment, measured statements/branches/functions/lines 100/100/100/100 across 23 sources, 0 duplicated lines across 43 tracked sources, 221/221 docstrings, zero production audit vulnerabilities, current changelog and attestation gates. The separate opted-in real-data run passed 2/2 with zero skips and completed pm-graph release:check in 432431 ms. pm health --strict-exit --json passes with stale_in_progress_items:3 advisory. CI and latest-head bot review are pending after push."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  dist/index.js,project,Tracked compiled package output
  index.ts,project,Bounded release-step timeout
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  "PM_OPS_TEST_REPOS=.,../pm-graph node --test --test-name-pattern=real-data: test/ops.test.ts",project,900,"harness:codex","2026-09-27T08:08:52.214Z",local_mutation,fix/pm-ops-hoisted-merge-driver-guard-2026-09-26
close_reason: "Reverified main 5804578: PR #124 (450e2bec) raises verify-release per-step execution to a bounded 20 minutes. The retained delivery receipt reports opted-in real pm-ops/pm-graph checks passing 2/2, with pm-graph release:check finishing in 432431 ms and verify-release reporting 1/1 repositories passed. Evidence: index.ts bounded timeout, test/ops.test.ts and dated item comments. No new live fleet run is asserted."
